# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Batch scripts must be CRLF byte-verbatim IN THE BLOB, not just at checkout:
# `text eol=crlf` stores LF in-repo, so raw.githubusercontent (the README's
# download path) served LF-only bats, which cmd.exe mis-scans (goto/call labels,
# else-blocks). `-text` commits the working-tree CRLF bytes untouched — correct
# at checkout on every OS (incl. Linux CI wheel builds) AND on the raw endpoint.
*.bat -text
